gs of tractors|Steering wheels in art|Uploaded by GPT-6-astra by Vitaly Zdanevich|Lottery tickets of the Soviet Union|Avtodor (society)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Ticket for the second All-Union automobile lottery of the Avtodor society, 50 kopecks; series 0003223, no. 041, division I. A worker in a cap and a bearded peasant hold a steering wheel. Factories, trucks, a motorcycle, tractors and rural buildings fill the background. A circular society emblem with a car appears above them; the banner reads \u201cThe automobile for the working people!\u201d The figures are red, with a blue background and border and a yellow field in the emblem. The ornamental border repeats the ticket title in Ukrainian, Belarusian, Georgian, Armenian and Azerbaijani. Signatures of the society council\u2019s chairman and lottery committee chairman appear at lower right.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1930","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.blavatnikarchive.org/item/36528\">Blavatnik Archive, Rowley Soviet Ephemera, ROW.00104, page 1</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__698e02ce356d5b442c7902147314bc89f1cda291fd30a11cbc6b04e513f431ef/full/max/0/default.jpg\">Full-resolution JPEG supplied by the archive\u2019s public IIIF service</a>, uploaded unchanged. Museum specimen of another division: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://moneymuseum.by/upload/iblock/ab7/4c7dxvlto85ge4c4finu2y4zirujpijs/2003.pdf#page=72\">\u0421\u0443\u0432\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0432, \u0412\u0438\u043a\u0442\u043e\u0440. \u00ab\u041d\u0430\u0434\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0430 \u2014 \u0432 \u043b\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0439\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0431\u0438\u043b\u0435\u0442\u0435\u00bb. \u0411\u0430\u043d\u043a\u0430